    "title": "Tutu.ru - flights, Russian railway and bus tickets",
    "creator": "Tutu.ru",
    "descriptionHtml": "Tutu.ru is the most popular travel service in Russia, with a large network all over the globe. Our app is all-in-one travel app with flights, bus and railway stations timetables, which also allows you to buy railway and bus tickets.<br>We compare more than 2287 partners, such as Aeroflot, RZD, S7, Pobeda and others to offer you the best ticket.<br>Our team is ready to support your travelling to Russia during the World Football Cup and gives you a chance to buy tickets to: Moscow, St. Petersburg, Ekaterinburg, Kaliningrad, Saransk, Volgograd, Kazan, Sochi, Nizhny Novgorod, Samara, Rostov-na-Donu",
